{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f This game is only available in Japanese.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no English translation at this time.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being asked by his childhood friend, a young man becomes her assistant in a small detective agency.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As mysteries unfold, you'll solve puzzles, fight enemies, and uncover hidden truths behind a series of strange incidents.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your target: the notorious phantom thief \u201cObrutale,\u201d  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a figure both feared and admired throughout the kingdom.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is his true purpose?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a personal project, developed as a hobby over five years. I hope you enjoy it.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3606680?t=1757870869","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606680/dfaee1e81b1daa9348fb6a541d8f48b256e010cb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757870869","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606680/ca482d4467e3f455daee23a4c980075d297a8a87/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757870869","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606680/ca482d4467e3f455daee23a4c980075d297a8a87/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757870869","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f This game is only available in Japanese.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no English translation at this time.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being asked by his childhood friend,